      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "name": "Roasted Goose Breast with Dried Apricots and Couscous",
          "category_label": "Dinner",
          "serving_unit_label": "serving",
          "instructions": [
            "Season the couscous with salt, pour double the volume of boiling salted water over it, cover, and let it sit for 20 minutes. Stir in the lime juice.",
            "Preheat the oven to 180 °C.",
            "Score the skin of the goose breasts in a crosshatch pattern. Heat a dry pan, place the breasts skin-side down, and slowly sear until crispy. Flip and sear the other side, placing thyme sprigs on top of the skin.",
            "Transfer the breasts to a baking dish, season with salt and black pepper, and bake in the oven for 8-10 minutes. Remove from the oven and let rest covered for 10 minutes.",
            "While the meat is baking, heat the honey in a pan until caramelized. Add the dried apricots and thyme leaves. Mix well, then stir in 2 tablespoons of the pan drippings from the baking dish.",
            "Slice the meat, drizzle with the apricot sauce, and serve alongside the couscous."
          ],
          "notes": null
        },
        "sk": {
          "name": "Pečené husacie prsia so sušenými marhuľami a kuskusom",
          "category_label": "Večera",
          "serving_unit_label": "porcia",
          "instructions": [
            "Kuskus osoľte, zalejte ho dvojnásobným množstvom vriacej osolenej vody a nechajte prikrytý stáť 20 minút. Vmiešajte limetkovú šťavu.",
            "Rúru predhrejte na 180 °C.",
            "Kožu na husacích prsiach narežte do mriežky. Rozpáľte panvicu bez tuku, vložte prsia kožou nadol a pomaly ich opečte do chrumkava. Potom ich otočte a opečte z druhej strany, pričom na kožu priložte vetvičky tymianu.",
            "Prsia preložte do zapekacej misy, osoľte, okoreňte a pečte v rúre 8 – 10 minút. Vyberte z rúry a nechajte prikryté postáť ďalších 10 minút.",
            "Kým sa mäso pečie, rozohrejte v panvici med a skaramelizujte ho. Pridajte sušené marhule a lístky tymianu. Dobre premiešajte a potom vmiešajte 2 polievkové lyžice výpeku zo zapekacej misy.",
            "Mäso nakrájajte na plátky, pokvapkajte omáčkou a podávajte s kuskusom."
          ],
          "notes": null
        }
      },
      "meal_prep_friendly": false
