      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "name": "Spinach Curry with Halloumi Cheese",
          "category_label": "Lunch",
          "serving_unit_label": "serving",
          "instructions": [
            "Bring salted water to a boil in a pot. Boil the spinach leaves for 30 seconds, then immediately transfer them to cold water so they retain their vibrant color.",
            "Drain the cooled spinach leaves and blend them with about 100 ml of water into a smooth puree.",
            "Heat the oil in a pan and toast the chili flakes and cumin seeds. Add the finely chopped garlic, sauté briefly, then stir in the finely chopped red onion. Season lightly with salt and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
            "Stir in the diced tomato, turmeric, and garam masala. Sauté everything together over high heat for 2 minutes.",
            "Pour the spinach puree into the pan and simmer everything together for about 3 minutes.",
            "Meanwhile, sear the halloumi cheese in a dry pan until golden brown on all sides. Cut it into cubes and serve alongside the hot spinach puree."
          ],
          "notes": null
        },
        "sk": {
          "name": "Špenátový prívarok s halloumi syrom",
          "category_label": "Obed",
          "serving_unit_label": "porcia",
          "instructions": [
            "V hrnci privedieme k varu osolenú vodu, v ktorej 30 sekúnd povaríme špenátové listy. Okamžite ich presunieme do studenej vody, aby nestratili farbu.",
            "Vychladnuté listy scedíme a rozmixujeme ich s asi 100 ml vody na hladké pyré.",
            "V panvici zahrejeme olej a opražíme na ňom čili vločky a rascu. Pridáme nadrobno nasekaný cesnak, krátko orestujeme a prisypeme nadrobno nakrájanú červenú cibuľu, ktorú zľahka osolíme a restujeme do sklovita.",
            "Spoločne primiešame na malé kocky nakrájanú paradajku, kurkumu, garam masalu a všetko spolu restujeme na silnom plameni 2 minúty.",
            "Nakoniec prilejeme pripravené špenátové pyré a všetko spolu povaríme cca 3 minúty.",
            "Medzitým si na suchej panvici dozlatista opečieme syr halloumi, pokrájame ho na kocky a podávame spolu so špenátovým pyré."
          ],
